! RT02 初期状態 (FNF TS・昨日 監視チームが FNF を導入した直後の状態)
interface Loopback0
 ip address 53.53.53.53 255.255.255.255
!
flow record REC-EDGE
 match ipv4 source address
 match ipv4 destination address
 match ipv4 protocol
 match transport source-port
 match transport destination-port
 collect counter bytes
 collect counter packets
!
flow exporter EXP-EDGE
 destination 203.0.113.48
 source Loopback0
 transport udp 9995
 export-protocol ipfix
!
flow monitor MON-EDGE
 record REC-EDGE
 exporter EXP-EDGE
!
interface {{ links[0] }}
 description === to RT01 (customer traffic in) ===
 ip address 10.136.7.2 255.255.255.252
 no shutdown
!
interface {{ links[1] }}
 description === to RT03 (upstream) ===
 ip address 10.136.8.1 255.255.255.252
 ip flow monitor MON-EDGE input
 no shutdown
!
router ospf 1
 router-id 53.53.53.53
 network 53.53.53.53 0.0.0.0 area 0
 network 10.136.7.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
 network 10.136.8.0 0.0.0.3 area 0
!
